      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is the balanced task list based on your conversation, focusing on meaningful technical work without artificially inflating the bullet count:\n\n1.  Fix authentication service 500 errors for long passwords on the login endpoint.\n2.  Optimize user profiles database migration script to prevent hangs on large tables.\n3.  Improve dashboard API call performance to reduce UI lag.\n4.  Update documentation for new API endpoints for frontend teams.\n5.  Apply security patch for the identified dependency vulnerability.\n\nThis list accurately reflects the team's adjusted priorities while ensuring each item represents a distinct, high-value effort rather than trivial sub-steps. It keeps the metrics compliant without sacrificing clarity for the developers and leads.",
